<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>治上焦火 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B2%BB%E4%B8%8A%E7%84%A6%E7%81%AB/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 18:15:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B2%BB%E4%B8%8A%E7%84%A6%E7%81%AB/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>饱治法：论治上焦火 论治上焦痰 论治胃寒 论治脾寒 论治痨虫 论消肺痰</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-38-ezhifa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 18:10:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-38-ezhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“饱治法”部分，专论借助&lt;strong&gt;饱食或饱餐药膳&lt;/strong&gt;以治疗上焦头目病、痰壅欲吐、胃寒脾寒、痨虫、顽痰等症的独特治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病在上焦宜饱饭后服药，使药力留于上焦；欲吐者饱食后服吐药，借食气助涌吐而不伤胃；脏腑虚寒者以药膳饱餐，使药力久留专补一经&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>